# Color Change Panel Application

This is a simple Java Swing application that displays a window with a black panel. When the user clicks anywhere on the panel, it randomly changes its background color.

## Features
- Creates a 300x300 window with a black panel
- Changes panel color randomly on each mouse click
- Generates random RGB colors (0-255 for each component)

## Technical Details
- Built using Java Swing framework
- Uses JFrame and JPanel for the GUI
- Implements MouseAdapter for click handling
- Utilizes Random class for color generation
